# Modelfile for "bard": the Qwen3-1.7B model you fine-tuned on Colab (bard_finetune.ipynb).
# 1. Put the downloaded bard.gguf in this finetune folder.
# 2. From the project folder run:  ollama create bard -f finetune\Modelfile.bard
# 3. Chat:                          ollama run bard
#
# Ollama reads Qwen3's chat template from the GGUF file itself, so no TEMPLATE line is needed.
# Note: no SYSTEM prompt asking for Shakespeare. The style comes purely from the fine-tuning,
# which is what this exercise demonstrates. "/no_think" only turns off Qwen3's reasoning step.

FROM ./bard.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048

SYSTEM """/no_think"""
